pstack
------
sikstack is its author's personal take on pstack, Lauren Tan's plugin for Claude Code
and Cursor (https://github.com/cursor/plugins, folder pstack; MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Lauren Tan). sikstack borrows pstack's ideas: install from a
marketplace and go with no account, one setup per machine, a rule loaded into every
session, and one entry point that routes the work to playbooks. It reshapes them around
its own phase-and-slice workflow.

No file in this repository is adapted from pstack: none of its code or text is copied
here. sikstack is not a fork of pstack, and it is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Cursor or Lauren Tan.

The workflow engine's earlier history
-------------------------------------
The workflow engine in plugins/sikstack/ was developed, with its history, in
https://github.com/leetusik/bootstrap_agentic_workspace.sh and published there under
the Apache License 2.0 until it moved into this repository in November 2026. Every
commit in that repository was authored by its sole author, leetusik, who relicenses
that work, and its history as carried here, under the MIT License above.
